# The sub-bank test with 20 sub-banks instead of 10: 20 autoencoders per latent size, then the bank sizes and
# the plot again with every model trained so far (one bank, 10 and 20 sub-banks). Needs the data step of
# svd_ae.dag (done); independent of svd_ae_subbanks.dag. Submit from this folder:
#   condor_submit_dag svd_ae_subbanks20.dag
# At most 40 CPUs at once (40 trainings x 1), then 50 single-CPU count jobs.

